From b298b6c72217140e0a494545e3868a9fa7a2cb76 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 09:00:50 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Add redacted server logs at /api/server-logs

Record page views, API calls, failed and slow requests, handler
exceptions, console errors and warnings, and process starts as daily
JSON lines on the Fly volume (/data/server-logs). Publish them
read-only at /api/server-logs with a summary (top 404s, 5xx routes,
slowest routes, repeated errors, restarts) plus recent entries, so
people and agents can see what fails in production without Fly access.

Everything is redacted before it is written: no IPs, query strings,
headers, cookies or bodies, and IDs, share codes, emails, tokens and
coordinates are stripped from paths and messages. Logs keep 14 days,
stop at 20 MB a day, and HBL_SERVER_LOGS=off disables them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011zJYagxyb5JPpjt5bub8jL
